kernora-desktop (1.3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Kernora Shapes: a live wallpaper of Material 3 Expressive shapes --
    cookies, flowers, suns -- turning on rounded orbits, passing over one
    another in turns and shifting colour on a seamless loop; it pauses
    behind maximised windows and when animations are off.
