    with an inset tonal hover, pill buttons, filled fields, Material
    check boxes, radio buttons, sliders, tabs and lists.
  * Kernora Qt Quick Controls style for System Settings and QML
    applications: Material buttons, switches, menus, list rows, tooltips,
    dialogs and progress, over KDE's desktop style.
  * Kernora window decoration: rounded title bar with Material Symbols
    buttons and a soft shadow.
  * Material Symbols for every System Settings module and a themed
    application icon for System Settings.
  * Application selections use the primary container; the colour schemes
    no longer carry an accent colour KDE would blend into them.

